_ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3454274491-410"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-412 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c2166473866-412 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-412"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-412 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-412"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-412">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-412"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-412 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_6b80bdba4f13c154" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_6b80bdba4f13c154" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">在 Spring Boot 2.x 中自定义 Starter 是一个非常有用的技能，它可以帮助你将通用的功能模块（如短信发送、OSS上传、自定义鉴权等）封装成可复用的组件，从而简化其他项目的配置。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="1">核心原理</h3><p data-path-to-node="2">自定义 Starter 的核心在于 <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="18">SPI (Service Provider Interface)</b> 机制。Spring Boot 启动时会扫描 <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="73">META-INF/spring.factories</code> 文件，加载其中配置的自动配置类（AutoConfiguration），并根据条件注解（<code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="142">@Conditional</code>）决定是否将 Bean 注入 Spring 容器。</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">开发步骤详解</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">为了演示方便，我们将创建一个简单的 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="18">hello-spring-boot-starter</code>，它的功能是根据配置文件中的参数，通过 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="63">HelloService</code> 打印欢迎语。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="6">1. 项目命名与结构</h4><p data-path-to-node="7">Spring Boot 官方建议的命名规则：</p><ul data-path-to-node="8"><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">官方 Starter：</b> <code data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="12">spring-boot-starter-{name}</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">第三方/自定义 Starter：</b> <code data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="17">{name}-spring-boot-starter</code></p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="9">我们创建一个 Maven 项目，命名为 <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="20">custom-hello-spring-boot-starter</code>。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="10">2. 添加依赖 (<code data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="9">pom.xml</code>)</h4><p data-path-to-node="11">你需要引入自动配置模块和配置处理器（用于生成 IDE 的配置提示）。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-457 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-457 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6b80bdba4f13c154&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_6d5db3ee6c0ed65e&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhAU" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-457 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-457">XML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-457 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-457 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6b80bdba4f13c154&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_6d5db3ee6c0ed65e&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" c