!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_347752b730a1e005" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_347752b730a1e005" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0"><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0">不一定。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="1">是否需要加版本号，取决于你的 Maven 项目并没有配置 <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="29">父工程（Parent）</b> 或 <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="43">依赖管理（Dependency Management/BOM）</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">在绝大多数标准的 Spring Boot 开发场景下，我们<b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="29">建议不加版本号</b>，交由 Spring Boot 统一管理。</p><p data-path-to-node="3">以下是详细的分情况说明：</p><hr data-path-to-node="4"><h3 data-path-to-node="5">情况一：不需要加版本号（推荐）</h3><p data-path-to-node="6">如果你的项目 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="7">pom.xml</code> 中满足以下<b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="20">任意一种</b>情况，则不需要（也不建议）手动写版本号：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">继承了 Spring Boot Parent</b>
