建议使用 <code data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="21">dependencyManagement</code> 来管理版本（情况一），这样可以确保你开发 Starter 时引用的 <code data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="76">autoconfigure</code>、<code data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="90">web</code> 等模块版本是匹配的。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">关于 <code data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="3">&lt;scope&gt;</code>：</b>
对于 <code data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="15">spring-boot-autoconfigure</code>，在自定义 Starter 中建议配合 <code data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="60">provided</code> 作用域或者 <code data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="75">optional</code>，虽然不是强制的，但这有助于减少传递依赖的体积，因为使用者的项目中通常已经有这个包了。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-486 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-486 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_347752b730a1e005&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dc08bf97f431bfa0&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrAU" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-486 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-486">XML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-486 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-486 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_347752b730a1e005&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dc08bf97f431bfa0&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="i