edby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3454274491-487"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-489 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c2166473866-489 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-489"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-489 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-489"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-489">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-489"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-489 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_1ab9140bfe590a78" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_1ab9140bfe590a78" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这三者（自动配置模块、配置处理器、以及自定义 Starter）的关系经常容易混淆。简单来说，一个是<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="49">干活的（核心逻辑）</b>，一个是<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="62">写说明书的（辅助工具）</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">以下是 <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="4">spring-boot-autoconfigure</code> 与 <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="32">spring-boot-configuration-processor</code> 的详细对比与作用解析：</p><h3 data-path-to-node="2">1. 核心作用对比</h3><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3726268734="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" class="table-block has-export-button has-scrollbar"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQvgU"><table data-path-to-node="3"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,0">特性</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="3,0,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">spring-boot-autoconfigure</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="3,0,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">spring-boot-configuration-processor</b></span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="3,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">角色</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="3,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">核心逻辑引擎 (Runtime)</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="3,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">辅助工具 (Compile-time)</b></span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="3,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">主要作用</b></span></td><td><p data-path-to-node="3,2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">"自动装配 Bean"</b></p><br data-path-to-node="3,2,1,1"><p data-path-to-node="3,2,1,2">在程序启动时，根据条件（是否有某个类、配置了某个属性）自动把 Bean 注入到 Spring 容器中。</p></td><td><p data-path-to-node="3,2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">"生成配置提示"</b></p><br data-path-to-node="3,2,2,1"><p data-path-to-node="3,2,2,2">在代码编译时，扫描 <code data-path-to-node="3,2,2,2" data-index-in-node="10">@ConfigurationProperties</code> 注解，生成元数据文件，让 IDE (IDEA/Eclipse) 能提示配置项。</p></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="3,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">生效阶段</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="3,3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">运行时 (Runtime)</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="3,3,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">编译时 (Compile-time)</b></span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="3,4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">产物</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="3,4,1,0">实际运行的 Bean 对象</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="3,4,2,0"><code data-path-to-node="3,4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">META-INF/spring-configuration-metadata.json</code> 文件</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="3,5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">必须性</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="3,5,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">必须</b> (对于 Starter 而言)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="3,5,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,5,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">可选</b> (不加也能跑，但写配置文件没提示，体验差)</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制表格" aria-label="复制表格" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_1ab9140bfe590a78&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><hr data-path-to-node="4"><h3 data-path-to-node="5">2. spring-boot-autoconfigure 详解</h3><p data-path-to-node="6">它是 Spring Boot "Magic" 的来源。</p><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">它的工作：</b> 它包含了一大堆 <code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="14">@Configuration</code> 类和条件注解（如 <code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="38">@ConditionalOnClass</code>）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">对于自定义 Starter：</b> 你引入它，是为了使用它的注解（如 <code data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="32">@ConditionalOnMissingBean</code>）来编写你自己的 <code data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="66">XxxAutoConfiguration</code> 类。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">实际场景：</b>
当你在 <code data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="10">pom.xml</code> 里引入 <code data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="22">spring-boot-starter-web</code> 时，就是因为这里面包含了 <code data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="59">autoconfigure</code>，Spring Boot 发现你引入了 Tomcat 和 Spring MVC 的包，就会自动帮你配置好 DispatcherServlet，而不需要你写 <code data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="150">web.xml</code>。</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="8">3. spring-boot-configuration-processor 详解</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">它是提升开发者体验的"幕后英雄"。</p><ul data-path-to-node="10"><li><p data-path-to-node="10,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">它的工作：</b> 它是一个 <b data-path-to-node="10,0,0" data-index-in-node="11">Java 注解处理器 (Annotation Processor)</b>。当你编译项目时，它会扫描你所有写了 <code data-path-to-node="10,0,0" data-index-in-node="63">@ConfigurationProperties</code> 的类。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">生成的产物：</b> 它会提取出属性的名称、类型、Javadoc 注释、默认值，然后生成一个 JSON 文件 (<code data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="52">spring-configuration-metadata.json</code>) 打包在你的 Jar 包里。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">实际场景：</b>
当你在 <code data-path-to-node="10,2,0" data-index-in-node="10">application.yml</code> 中输入 <code data-path-to-node="10,2,0" data-index-in-node="30">server.p</code> 然后 IDEA 自动联想出 <code data-path-to-node="10,2,0" data-index-in-node="53">server.port</code> 并且告诉你默认值是 8080，这就是这个 Processor 的功劳。</p><p data-path-to-node="10,2,1"><b data-path-to-node="10,2,1" data-index-in-node="0">如果你不加这个依赖：</b> 你的 Starter 依然可以正常运行，但是别人在使用你的 Starter 时，在 <code data-path-to-node="10,2,1" data-index-in-node="53">application.yml</code> 里敲配置不会有任何智能提示，容易写错。</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="11">4. 在 pom.xml 中的最佳配置建议</h3><p data-path-to-node="12">在开发 <b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="4">自定义 Starter</b> 时，通常这样配置：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-496 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-496 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_1ab9140bfe590a78&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_da7c2499a5d5fa38&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQwAU" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-496 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-496">XML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-496 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-496 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-b