04"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-506 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c2166473866-506 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-506"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-506 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-506"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-506">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-506"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-506 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_f6474fd6b521d052" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_f6474fd6b521d052" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">结论：<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="3">引入 <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="6">spring-boot-autoconfigure</code> 就足够了。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="1">你<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="1">不需要</b>为了读取 YAML 配置而专门引入 <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="22">spring-boot-starter</code>。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">以下是详细的原因分析和最佳实践建议：</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">1. 为什么 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="7">autoconfigure</code> 就够了？</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">要理解这一点，我们需要区分 <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="14">“定义配置”</b> 和 <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="23">“解析配置”</b> 这两个动作：</p><ul data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">你的 Starter 负责“定义配置”：</b>
你在 Starter 中编写 <code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="36">HelloProperties</code> 类，并使用 <code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="58">@ConfigurationProperties</code> 注解。这个注解包含在 <code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="94">spring-boot</code> 核心包中。</p><ul data-path-to-node="5,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0,0">依赖链：<code data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="4">spring-boot-autoconfigure</code> -&gt; 依赖 <code data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="36">spring-boot</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,1,1,0">所以，只要有了 <code data-path-to-node="5,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="8">autoconfigure</code>，你就有能力写代码来“接收”配置。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">使用者的项目负责“解析 YAML”：</b>
真正的 YAML 文件解析动作（Parsing）是由 <b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="46">使用你 Starter 的那个项目（主程序）</b> 来完成的。
主程序（Consumer）肯定已经引入了 <code data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="96">spring-boot-starter</code>（包含 SnakeYAML 解析库）来启动 Spring Boot。它会把 YAML 解析好，然后根据你定义的规则，把值注入到你的类中。</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="6">2. 为什么<b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="6">不建议</b>引入 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="12">spring-boot-starter</code>？</h3><p data-path-to-node="7">如果在你的自定义 Starter 中引入了 <code data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="22">spring-boot-starter</code>，会带来以下副作用：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="8"><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">依赖传递（传递了日志框架）：</b>
<code data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="15">spring-boot-starter</code> 默认包含 <code data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="40">spring-boot-starter-logging</code> (Logback + SLF4J)。
如果引用你 Starter 的用户想使用 <b data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="108">Log4j2</b> 而不是 Logback，他们引入你的 Starter 后，就会发现被迫引入了 Logback，导致日志冲突（Jar Conflict），他们还得手动去你的依赖里 <code data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="196">&lt;exclusion&gt;</code> 掉它，非常麻烦。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">违背“轻量级”原则：</b>
Starter 应该尽可能保持纯净，只包含业务逻辑和自动配置逻辑，不要夹带“私货”（基础运行环境）。</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="9">3. 标准的 Starter 依赖配置模版</h3><p data-path-to-node="10">为了让你的 Starter 既能读取配置，又保持轻量，这是最标准的 <code data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="34">pom.xml</code> 配置：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-514 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-514 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f6474fd6b521d052&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_5e4324d014005650&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ4gU" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-514 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-514">XML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-514 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-514 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f6474fd6b521d052&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_5e4324d014005650&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds