_ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-517"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-517 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_0d6845776e9af305" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_0d6845776e9af305" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">Spring Boot 自动装配（Auto-Configuration）自定义 Starter 的核心原理可以概括为：<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="59">SPI 机制 + <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="68">@Import</code> 动态注入 + 条件注解过滤</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">简单来说，就是 Spring Boot 在启动时，会去扫描所有 Jar 包里的特定文件，找到里面列出的配置类，然后根据“条件”决定是否要把这些配置类加载到容器中。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">下面我将从 <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="6">启动流程</b>、<b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="11">加载机制</b>、<b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="16">过滤机制</b> 三个核心步骤为你深度拆解：</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">第一步：启动与触发 (@EnableAutoConfiguration)</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">一切的起点都在主启动类的 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="13">@SpringBootApplication</code> 注解上。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-542 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-542 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0d6845776e9af305&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dfa68eada7200471&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ-gU" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-542 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-542">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-542 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-542 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0d6845776e9af305&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dfa68eada7200471&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></