</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="7">这个注解是一个复合注解，其中最关键的是 <b data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="20"><code data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="20">@EnableAutoConfiguration</code></b>。它的作用是告诉 Spring Boot：“请帮我开启自动装配功能”。</p><p data-path-to-node="8">在 <code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="2">@EnableAutoConfiguration</code> 内部，使用了一个 <code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="36">From</code> 导入机制：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-543 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-543 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0d6845776e9af305&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dfa68eada7200471&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ-wU" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-543 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-543">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-543 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-543 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0d6845776e9af305&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dfa68eada7200471&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-543"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-543"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-543"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-543"><span class="hljs-meta">@Import(AutoConfigurationImportSelector.class)</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-meta">@interface</span> EnableAutoConfiguration { ... }
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="10"><b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="0">AutoConfigurationImportSelector</code></b> 是核心类，它的职责就是：<b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="44">决定要导入哪些配置类</b>。</p><hr data-path-to-node="11"><h3 data-path-to-node="12">第二步：扫描与加载 (SPI 机制)</h3><p data-path-to-node="13">当 <code data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="2">AutoConfigurationImportSelector</code> 开始工作时，它会执行以下逻辑（针对 Spring Boot 2.x）：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="14"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">利用 Java SPI 扩展机制：</b>
它会调用 <code data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="23">SpringFactoriesLoader.loadFactoryNames()</code> 方法。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">全盘扫描：</b>
这个方法会扫描 <b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="14">所有</b> 引入的 Jar 包（包括官方的和你自定义的 Starter）下的 <code data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="50">META-INF/spring.factories</code> 文件。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">寻找目标：</b>
它只关心 <code data-path-to-node="14,2,0" data-index-in-node="11">spring.factories</code> 中 Key 为 <code data-path-to-node="14,2,0" data-index-in-node="36">org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.EnableAutoConfiguration</code> 对应的值。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="15"><b data-path-to-node="15" data-index-in-node="0">对应你的自定义 Starter：</b>
你在 <code data-path-to-node="15" data-index-in-node="20">custom-starter</code> 里写的 <code data-path-to-node="15" data-index-in-node="39">META-INF/spring.factories</code>：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-544 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-544 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0d6845776e9af305&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dfa68eada7200471&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ_AU" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-544 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-544">Properties</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-544 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-544 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0d6845776e9af305&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dfa68eada7200471&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-544"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-544"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-544"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-544"><span class="hljs-meta">org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.EnableAutoConfiguration</span>=<span class="hljs-string">\
com.example.HelloAutoConfiguration</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="17">Spring Boot 就在这一步扫描到了 <code data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="22">com.example.HelloAutoConfiguration</code> 这个全限定名，并把它加入到了“待加载候选名单”中。</p><hr data-path-to-node="18"><h3 data-path-to-node="19">第三步：按需过滤 (@Conditional)</h3><p data-path-to-node="20">此时，Spring Boot 手里可能拿到了上百个自动配置类（Web、Redis、Jdbc、还有你的 Hello...）。如果全部加载，内存就爆了，而且会报错（比如没引 Redis 包却加载 Redis 配置）。</p><p data-path-to-node="21">所以，Spring Boot 会遍历这个名单，对每个配置类进行 <b data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="32">“条件判断”</b>。这就是你在自定义 Starter 中写的那些注解在起作用：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="22"><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">@ConditionalOnClass</code>：</b>
检查 classpath 下有没有 <code data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="39">HelloService</code> 类？如果有，说明用户引入了你的 jar 包，<b data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="74">通过</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">@ConditionalOnProperty</code>：</b>
检查配置文件里有没有 <code data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="35">custom.hello.enabled=true</code>？如果用户显式关闭了，<b data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="71">不通过</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="22,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">@ConditionalOnMissingBean</code>：</b>
检查容器里是不是已经有人手动写了个 <code data-path-to-node="22,2,0" data-index-in-node="45">HelloService</code>？如果有了，你的默认配置就<b data-path-to-node="22,2,0" data-index-in-node="70">不通过</b>（让位给用户）。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="23">只有<b data-path-to-node="23" data-index-in-node="2">同时满足</b>所有条件的配置类，才会被最终注册到 Spring IOC 容器中。</p><hr data-path-to-node="24"><h3 data-path-to-node="25">第四步：属性绑定</h3><p data-path-to-node="26">配置类加载成功后，<code data-path-to-node="26" data-index-in-node="9">@EnableConfigurationProperties(HelloProperties.class)</code> 开始工作：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="27"><li><p data-path-to-node="27,0,0">它把 <code data-path-to-node="27,0,0" data-index-in-node="3">HelloProperties</code> 注册为 Bean。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="27,1,0">它去 <code data-path-to-node="27,1,0" data-index-in-node="3">application.yaml</code> 中查找 <code data-path-to-node="27,1,0" data-index-in-node="24">custom.hello</code> 前缀的配置。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="27,2,0">将 YAML 中的值自动赋值给 <code data-path-to-node="27,2,0" data-index-in-node="16">HelloProperties</code> 对象的字段。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="27,3,0">最后，将这个填好值的 Properties 对象注入给 <code data-path-to-node="27,3,0" data-index-in-node="28">HelloService</code>。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="28"><h3 data-path-to-node="29">总结：自定义 Starter 的“上位”之路</h3><p data-path-to-node="30">我们可以把这个过程想象成一次 <b data-path-to-node="30" data-index-in-node="15">“应聘”</b>：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="31"><li><p data-path-to-node="31,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">发布招聘 (<code data-path-to-node="31,0,0" data-index-in-node="6">@EnableAutoConfiguration</code>)：</b> 项目启动，老板说要招人。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="31,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">投递简历 (<code data-path-to-node="31,1,0" data-index-in-node="6">spring.factories</code>)：</b> 你的 Starter 通过这个文件把 <code data-path-to-node="31,1,0" data-index-in-node="44">HelloAutoConfiguration</code> 的简历投递进了候选池。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="31,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">面试筛选 (<code data-path-to-node="31,2,0" data-index-in-node="6">@Conditional</code>)：</b> 面试官检查你是否符合要求（类存在吗？配置开了吗？）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="31,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">正式入职 (<code data-path-to-node="31,3,0" data-index-in-node="6">Bean</code> 注册)：</b> 面试通过，你的 <code data-path-to-node="31,3,0" data-index-in-node="24">HelloService</code> 正式进入公司（容器）开始干活。</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="32">核心代码调用链（供参考）</h3><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-545 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-545 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0d6845776e9af305&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dfa68eada7200471&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ_QU" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-545 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-545">Plaintext</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-545 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-545 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0d6845776e9af305&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_dfa68eada7200471&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-545"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-545"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-545"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-545">SpringApplication.run()
  └── refreshContext()
      └── invokeBeanFactoryPostProcessors()
          └── ConfigurationClassPostProcessor
              └── AutoConfigurationImportSelector.selectImports()
                  └── getCandidateConfigurations()
                      └── SpringFactoriesLoader.loadFactoryNames()
