拦截器里不应该写死 <code data-path-to-node="39,0,0" data-index-in-node="22">if ("invalid_token".equals(token))</code>。应该定义一个 <code data-path-to-node="39,0,0" data-index-in-node="64">TokenService</code> 接口。
Starter 提供一个默认实现（比如只校验非空）。使用者可以在自己的项目中实现 <code data-path-to-node="39,0,0" data-index-in-node="122">TokenService</code>（接入 Redis 或 JWT），Starter 利用 <code data-path-to-node="39,0,0" data-index-in-node="162">@ConditionalOnMissingBean</code> 优先使用用户的实现。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="39,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="39,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">参数解析器 (ArgumentResolver)</b>：
为了让代码更优雅，可以实现 <code data-path-to-node="39,1,0" data-index-in-node="40">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code>。
<b data-path-to-node="39,1,0" data-index-in-node="71">效果</b>：Controller 写法变成 <code data-path-to-node="39,1,0" data-index-in-node="90">public Result test(@CurrentUser AuthUser user)</code>，不再需要手动调用 <code data-path-to-node="39,1,0" data-index-in-node="146">UserContext.get()</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="39,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="39,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">异常处理</b>：
拦截器中抛出的 <code data-path-to-node="39,2,0" data-index-in-node="14">RuntimeException</code> 可能会导致 500 错误。建议在 Starter 中配合 <code data-path-to-node="39,2,0" data-index-in-node="60">@RestControllerAdvice</code> 或者让拦截器直接 <code data-path-to-node="39,2,0" data-index-in-node="91">response.getWriter().write(json)</code> 返回标准的 401 JSON 格式。</p></li></ol></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile has-thoughts gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3454274491-553"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1927598164="" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-575 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1927598164-575 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="spacer ng-tns-c1927598164-575 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-575"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-575"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c413749340="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserte