p="更多" tabindex="0" aria-label="显示更多选项" data-test-id="more-menu-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button more-button ng-tns-c3454274491-596 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-138" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3454274491-596"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-598 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c2166473866-598 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-598"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-598 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-598"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-598">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-598"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-598 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_a6dee1c213c2b5e8" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_a6dee1c213c2b5e8" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个架构师级别的提问。将通用逻辑是放在传统的 <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="25">common</code> 包中，还是封装成 <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="41">starter</code>，决定了你团队的<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="56">开发效率</b>和<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="61">代码耦合度</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">我们可以用一个比喻来区分它们：</p><ul data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Common 包</b>：像是一个 <b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="14">“工具箱”</b>。你把它买回家（引入依赖），还得自己打开盖子，拿出里面的扳手（手动配置 Bean、扫描包），看着说明书才能干活。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Starter</b>：像是一个 <b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="13">“上门服务团队”</b>。你把它请回家（引入依赖），它自己带着工具，看到你家有水管坏了（条件触发），就自动帮你修好了，你什么都不用管。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="3">以下是全方位的优劣势对比：</p><h3 data-path-to-node="4">1. 核心对比维度表</h3><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3726268734="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" class="table-block has-export-button"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQwQY"><table data-path-to-node="5"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,0,0,0">维度</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0">Common 包 (普通 Jar)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,0,2,0">Custom Starter (自动装配)</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">设计理念</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">被动式</b>：提供类库，等待被调用</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">主动式</b>：提供能力，自动装配环境</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">使用成本</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">高</b>：通常需要手动 <code data-path-to-node="5,2,1,0" data-index-in-node="9">@ComponentScan</code>，手动 <code data-path-to-node="5,2,1,0" data-index-in-node="27">@Import</code>，手动配 Bean</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">极低</b>：引入 Maven 依赖即生效 (Plug &amp; Play)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">开发成本</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">低</b>：写完类直接打包即可</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,3,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">中</b>：需要写 AutoConfiguration、spring.factories，处理条件注解</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">灵活性</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">差</b>：代码逻辑写死，要么全用，要么不用</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,4,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">极强</b>：通过 <code data-path-to-node="5,4,2,0" data-index-in-node="6">@Conditional</code> 可按需加载，通过 YAML 开关功能</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">版本解耦</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">弱</b>：容易导致 Jar 包冲突，依赖传递难以控制</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,5,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,5,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">强</b>：可以将依赖设为 <code data-path-to-node="5,5,2,0" data-index-in-node="10">optional</code>，根据主工程环境自动适配</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="5,6,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,6,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">配置提示</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,6,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,6,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">无</b>：通常靠口口相传或查文档</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="5,6,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,6,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">有</b>：IDE 自动提示 YAML 配置项 (Metadata)</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制表格" aria-label="复制表格" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a6dee1c213c2b5e8&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><hr data-path-to-node="6"><h3 data-path-to-node="7">2. Common 包模式 (传统方式)</h3><p data-path-to-node="8">这是 SSM 时代遗留下来的习惯。通常把工具类（DateUtils）、实体类（POJO）、甚至一些 Service 都塞进去。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="9">✅ 优势</h4><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="10"><li><p data-path-to-node="10,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">简单粗暴</b>：开发速度快，新建一个 Module，把代码贴进去，<code data-path-to-node="10,0,0" data-index-in-node="30">mvn install</code> 就能用。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">适合静态资源</b>：对于纯粹的 POJO、DTO、Enum、Utils 工具类，Common 包是最佳归宿（不需要 Spring 容器管理的类）。</p></li></ol><h4 data-path-to-node="11">❌ 劣势</h4><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="12"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">包路径地狱</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="12,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,1,0,0">如果 <code data-path-to-node="12,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="3">Common</code> 包的包名是 <code data-path-to-node="12,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="16">com.company.common</code>，而主项目是 <code data-path-to-node="12,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="41">com.company.project</code>。Spring Boot 默认只扫描主项目包，导致 Common 里的 <code data-path-to-node="12,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="96">@Component</code> 扫描不到。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">后果</b>：主项目启动类必须加 <code data-path-to-node="12,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="13">@ComponentScan({"com.company.project", "com.company.common"})</code>，非常丑陋且容易忘。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">强耦合与依赖污染</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="12,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,1,0,0">Common 包里引入了 <code data-path-to-node="12,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="13">fastjson</code>，任何引用 Common 的项目都会被强制引入 <code data-path-to-node="12,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="45">fastjson</code>。如果你想在一个新项目用 <code data-path-to-node="12,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="66">Jackson</code>，就会产生冲突。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,1,1,0">Common 包往往会变成“垃圾桶”，谁都往里塞东西，最后体积巨大。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">配置繁琐</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="12,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,2,1,0,0">如果 Common 里有一个拦截器，使用者必须手动在自己的 <code data-path-to-node="12,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="30">WebConfig</code> 里 <code data-path-to-node="12,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="42">registry.addInterceptor(new CommonInterceptor())</code>，无法做到开箱即用。</p></li></ul></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="13"><h3 data-path-to-node="14">3. Custom Starter 模式 (Spring Boot 方式)</h3><p data-path-to-node="15">这是现代微服务的标准解法。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="16">✅ 优势</h4><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="17"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">真正的开箱即用</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="17,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,0,1,0,0">使用者只需引入 <code data-path-to-node="17,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="8">&lt;dependency&gt;</code>，不需要写一行 Java 配置代码，功能直接生效。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="17,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">智能装配 (Conditionals)</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="17,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,1,1,0,0">比如你的 Starter 里封装了 Redis 功能。通过 <code data-path-to-node="17,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="30">@ConditionalOnClass(RedisOperations.class)</code>，只有当主项目引入了 Redis 驱动时，你的配置才生效。如果主项目没引 Redis，你的 Starter 就静默，不会报错。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="17,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">标准化配置</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="17,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,2,1,0,0">通过 <code data-path-to-node="17,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="3">spring-boot-configuration-processor</code> 生成元数据，开发人员在 <code data-path-to-node="17,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="51">application.yml</code> 里输入配置时有高亮和提示，体验极佳。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="17,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">去除非必要依赖</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="17,3,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,3,1,0,0">Starter 可以利用 <code data-path-to-node="17,3,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="13">optional</code> 依赖，避免污染主工程的依赖树。</p></li></ul></li></ol><h4 data-path-to-node="18">❌ 劣势</h4><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="19"><li><p data-path-to-node="19,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">开发门槛稍高</b>：需要理解 SPI、自动配置原理、条件注解等知识。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">调试相对麻烦</b>：因为是隐式加载，如果配置不生效，需要查看 <code data-path-to-node="19,1,0" data-index-in-node="28">/actuator/conditions</code> 或开启 <code data-path-to-node="19,1,0" data-index-in-node="53">debug=true</code> 来看日志排查。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="20"><h3 data-path-to-node="21">4. 代码层面对比 (直观感受)</h3><p data-path-to-node="22">假设我们要封装一个 <b data-path-to-node="22" data-index-in-node="10">“发送短信”</b> 的功能。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="23">场景：Common 包模式</h4><p data-path-to-node="24"><b data-path-to-node="24" data-index-in-node="0">开发者 A (写库的人):</b> 写一个 <code data-path-to-node="24" data-index-in-node="18">SmsUtil</code> 类。
<b data-path-to-node="24" data-index-in-node="29">开发者 B (用库的人):</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="25"><li><p data-path-to-node="25,0,0">引入 jar 包。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="25,1,0">在 <code data-path-to-node="25,1,0" data-index-in-node="2">application.properties</code> 加 <code data-path-to-node="25,1,0" data-index-in-node="27">sms.key=123</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="25,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="25,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">痛苦时刻</b>：写一个 <code data-path-to-node="25,2,0" data-index-in-node="9">@Configuration</code> 类：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-609 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-609 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a6dee1c213c2b5e8&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4d8c0a11d5db0c65&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQwwY" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-609 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-609">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-609 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-609 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a6dee1c213c2b5e8&quot;,&quot;c_df