<b data-path-to-node="27" data-index-in-node="52">开发者 B (用库的人):</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="28"><li><p data-path-to-node="28,0,0">引入 starter 依赖。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="28,1,0">在 <code data-path-to-node="28,1,0" data-index-in-node="2">application.yaml</code> 加 <code data-path-to-node="28,1,0" data-index-in-node="21">sms.key=123</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="28,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">直接注入</b>：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-610 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-610 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a6dee1c213c2b5e8&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4d8c0a11d5db0c65&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQxAY" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-610 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-610">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-610 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-610 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a6dee1c213c2b5e8&quot;,&quot;c_df13630aab5a71bc&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4d8c0a11d5db0c65&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-610"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-610"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-610"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-610"><span class="hljs-meta">@Autowired</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> SmsUtil smsUtil; <span class="hljs-comment">// 直接用，Spring 容器里已经自动有了</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="29"><h3 data-path-to-node="30">5. 最佳实践建议：怎么选？</h3><p data-path-to-node="31">不要二选一，通常是 <b data-path-to-node="31" data-index-in-node="10">组合使用</b>。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="32">建议放入 Common 包 (Library) 的内容：</h4><ul data-path-to-node="33"><li><p data-path-to-node="33,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="33,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">纯静态代码</b>：不需要 Spring 容器管理的类。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="33,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="33,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">数据模型</b>：DTO, VO, Entity, Enums。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="33,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="33,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">工具类</b>：StringUtils, DateUtils, EncryptionUtils。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="33,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="33,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">常量接口</b>：Constants。</p></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node="34">建议放入 Starter 的内容：</h4><ul data-path-to-node="35"><li><p data-path-to-node="35,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="35,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">需要注入 Bean 的逻辑</b>：Service, Controller, Interceptor, Filter。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="35,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="35,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">技术组件封装</b>：OSS 客户端, 短信客户端, 支付客户端。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="35,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="35,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">切面逻辑</b>：全局日志, 鉴权, 限流, 分布式锁。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="35,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="35,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">中间件增强</b>：MybatisPlus 配置, RedisTemplate 定制序列化。</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="36">总结</h3><ul data-path-to-node="37"><li><p data-path-to-node="37,0,0">如果你的代码主要是给 <b data-path-to-node="37,0,0" data-index-in-node="11">编译器</b> 用的（类定义、接口、工具函数），用 <b data-path-to-node="37,0,0" data-index-in-node="33">Common</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="37,1,0">如果你的代码主要是给 <b data-path-to-node="37,1,0" data-index-in-node="11">运行环境</b> 用的（需要 new 对象、管理生命周期、读取配置），用 <b data-path-to-node="37,1,0" data-index-in-node="44">Starter</b>。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="38"><b data-path-to-node="38" data-index-in-node="0">您现在的项目中，是否有一些放在 Common 包里，但每次新项目使用时都需要手动 Copy 很多配置代码的功能？我们可以拿一个出来尝试重构为 Starter。</b></p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3454274491-596"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1927598164="" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-608 ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1927598164-608 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="spacer ng-tns-c1927598164-608 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-608"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-608"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer